Mythix build compat for mythix-11.19 — source-level shims so the GE stack
builds against the Ubuntu 24.04 container's older system libraries.
Each shim is a no-op when the newer library is present (guarded by #ifndef /
version checks), so the same tree builds natively on current distros too.

  * winewayland.drv: XKB_VMOD_NAME_SCROLL (libxkbcommon >= 1.7)

Curated 2026-10-06 against the mythix-11.19 tree (GE a3f58c5 + 0001).
---
diff --git a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_keyboard.c b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_keyboard.c
index 41397717..359dee56 100644
--- a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_keyboard.c
+++ b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_keyboard.c
@@ -36,6 +36,12 @@
 #include "wine/debug.h"
 #include "wine/server.h"
 
+/* Mythix build compat: libxkbcommon < 1.7 (Ubuntu 24.04 ships 1.6) lacks the
+ * virtual modifier name macros; the values are fixed by the XKB spec. */
+#ifndef XKB_VMOD_NAME_SCROLL
+#define XKB_VMOD_NAME_SCROLL "ScrollLock"
+#endif
+
 WINE_DEFAULT_DEBUG_CHANNEL(keyboard);
 WINE_DECLARE_DEBUG_CHANNEL(key);
 
